{"parse": {"title": "吼吼自选衣箱", "pageid": 123418, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"吼吼自选衣箱\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5f/Item-713201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"吼吼自选衣箱\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>吼吼自选衣箱</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#713201</div></div><hr /><div>由“告别安宁夜”社团臻选、量身定制、别具匠心的衣箱，开启后可自选一件指定范围内的衣着（该衣箱自选范围截至1.0~2.6版本的吼吼点唱机衣着）。若在已拥有、未使用该衣箱的情况下，拥有衣箱内所有衣着，则使用衣箱将自动退还1360辉光丝。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">别出新意，抑或低调从容？亲爱的，这儿的每一件衣裳——都在静静等待你的垂青。嘈杂的乐音和窸窣声已经压抑不住，请不要冷落它们。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"306204\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD\" title=\"衣着/红与白\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD\" title=\"红与白\"><img alt=\"红与白\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Item_heroskin-306204.png/100px-Item_heroskin-306204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Item_heroskin-306204.png/150px-Item_heroskin-306204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Item_heroskin-306204.png/200px-Item_heroskin-306204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD\" title=\"衣着/红与白\">红与白</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">玫瑰的诡计，百合的把戏，一点无伤大雅的玩笑。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"300306\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%84\" title=\"衣着/荆棘环绕处\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%84\" title=\"荆棘环绕处\"><img alt=\"荆棘环绕处\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item_heroskin-300306.png/100px-Item_heroskin-300306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item_heroskin-300306.png/150px-Item_heroskin-300306.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item_heroskin-300306.png/200px-Item_heroskin-300306.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%84\" title=\"衣着/荆棘环绕处\">荆棘环绕处</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">乌鸦们齐声高唱：月已升起。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"309503\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A2\" title=\"衣着/午夜曼波\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A2\" title=\"午夜曼波\"><img alt=\"午夜曼波\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Item_heroskin-309503.png/100px-Item_heroskin-309503.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Item_heroskin-309503.png/150px-Item_heroskin-309503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Item_heroskin-309503.png/200px-Item_heroskin-309503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A2\" title=\"衣着/午夜曼波\">午夜曼波</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">摇曳，摇曳，虚幻中看见真我。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"304304\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%89%B4%E8%B5%8F%E5%AE%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%88%98\" title=\"衣着/鉴赏家之战\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%89%B4%E8%B5%8F%E5%AE%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%88%98\" title=\"鉴赏家之战\"><img alt=\"鉴赏家之战\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Item_heroskin-304304.png/100px-Item_heroskin-304304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Item_heroskin-304304.png/150px-Item_heroskin-304304.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Item_heroskin-304304.png/200px-Item_heroskin-304304.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%89%B4%E8%B5%8F%E5%AE%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%88%98\" title=\"衣着/鉴赏家之战\">鉴赏家之战</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">精准、果决，以及一点点必要的冷酷，她精于此道。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"308203\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE\" title=\"衣着/蓝河湾\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE\" title=\"蓝河湾\"><img alt=\"蓝河湾\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Item_heroskin-308203.png/100px-Item_heroskin-308203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Item_heroskin-308203.png/150px-Item_heroskin-308203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Item_heroskin-308203.png/200px-Item_heroskin-308203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE\" title=\"衣着/蓝河湾\">蓝河湾</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">她如此贴近水流，以至能看清其中数不尽的蓝。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"306003\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A\" title=\"衣着/铅黄色磨坊\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A\" title=\"铅黄色磨坊\"><img alt=\"铅黄色磨坊\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Item_heroskin-306003.png/100px-Item_heroskin-306003.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Item_heroskin-306003.png/150px-Item_heroskin-306003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Item_heroskin-306003.png/200px-Item_heroskin-306003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A\" title=\"衣着/铅黄色磨坊\">铅黄色磨坊</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">我们有湖，有小屋，还有意想不到的邂逅！</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"307103\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A2\" title=\"衣着/午夜来客\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A2\" title=\"午夜来客\"><img alt=\"午夜来客\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/Item_heroskin-307103.png/100px-Item_heroskin-307103.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploa